ind":"update","title":"Demo Update!","summary":"- UI related to golfing no longer get caught behind objects- Rebalance Tier 4 for demo- Arrow keys can be used for movement alongside WASD- \"RESET SAVE DATA\" button now has an an \"Are you sure\" button- When in build mode, the piece you are interacting with highlights to help prevent deleting the wrong piece","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T05:26:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388417","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4901780-1836506165582097","game_id":"steam-4901780","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.6","summary":"I added a cutscene that helps to flesh out the story. Working on adding more that unlock when you reach a new tier. Also added a bug reporting system and the ability to reset your save data if you reach the end of the demo and want to start over. More updates to come.Thank you everybody for playing so far. Don't forget to leave a review of the demo on steam if you enjoyed the game. You would not believe the traction that it gives the game in the steam algorithm.- Phil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T02:33:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165582097","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:27:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4901780-1836506165577586","game_id":"steam-4901780","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Bug Fix 0.3","summary":"There was an issue with the bouncer block where you could generate quintillions of dollars and trigger stack overflow which would basically ruin your game. I fixed the stack overflow to make it impossible, however, if you were one of the unlucky people who this happened to, your money is reset 